    title="Prognostic Accuracy of qSOFA, NEWS2 and SIRS at Emergency Department Triage for In-Hospital Mortality and ICU Admission Among Adults with Suspected Infection: A Retrospective Diagnostic Accuracy Study in a Saudi Hospital",
