        "To assess accuracy for the composite outcome of ICU admission or in-hospital death within 7 days.",
        "To evaluate whether adding serum lactate improves discrimination (where available).",
        "To describe the proportion of patients receiving antibiotics within 1 hour of ED arrival (exploratory quality indicator).",
