    gap="Saudi data link late arrival to living outside Riyadh city [4], and Majmaah community knowledge is limited [5]. However, the search for this portfolio did not identify a study measuring <b>actual</b> onset-to-door times, EMS use and decision-making among stroke patients from non-metropolitan Riyadh Region governorates. This is a <b>regional gap</b> that connects existing knowledge surveys with real patient behaviour.",
